          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A specialist family law solicitor with no content, no SEO strategy and national firms owning every search that mattered."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Family law is one of the most competitive legal search categories in Ireland. The firm had a brochure site and no way to show its expertise to people searching at 11pm with a difficult question."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Content strategy built from the questions people actually search before calling a solicitor",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Technical audit and site clean-up",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Forty long-form articles written with the solicitor, reviewed for accuracy",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Author profiles, credentials and trust signals on every page",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Local SEO for 'family law solicitor' plus location searches",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The firm ranks on page one for eight high-value family law searches and organic enquiries are up 120%."
        }
      ]
